      "content": "idk, it sounds a bit like you're saying democracy is inherently better than other systems, so we should be allowed to police them. if a country is developing a strong government that just happens to be non-democratic but isn't actually attacking anyone, shouldn't we just leave them alone? isn't it a bit hypocritical to claim we're \"protecting stability\" when we're actually just imposing our own political values on everyone else?",
